---
// Answer-first opener: the key fact with a number, date, status and source, right under the H1.
---
<div class="answer"><slot /></div>
<style>
  .answer { max-width: 70ch; font-size: var(--s1); line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 4px; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--sun); }
  .answer :global(p) { margin: 0; }
  .answer :global(p + p) { margin-top: 8px; font-size: var(--s0); color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
